{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）早上9時39分，警方接報尖沙咀金巴利道39號一間酒店內有人暈倒。人員到場發現一名40餘歲男子昏迷不醒，當場經檢驗證實已告身亡。</p><p>警方正調查其身份及事件，暫列有人暈倒案件跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"尖沙咀金巴利道39號一間酒店，一名40餘歲男子身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149301351893700608574098.jpeg/wICOcPQGTo3BeR0Ja1viii21O8mUJnRdeNFycnjRcnI\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀金巴利道39號一間酒店，一名40餘歲男子身亡。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方帶走證物離開。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149304087536209920247903.jpeg/ANAyjtipfZ33QlmZSGBnI4q5pGcEP75Xic4ucqPOLnI\"/><figcaption>警方帶走證物離開。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149301527081390080739058.jpeg/9JDi74gvrWWX8zEmYoaUWGtlrXpJ7CxCZH-8bWR_vG0\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T02:59:06.350898+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}